  "caption": "Mandarin jazz-pop waltz in 3/4, small-club style. Brushed snare and soft ride cymbal swinging in three, upright piano comping warm chords, walking upright bass on the downbeats, muted trumpet answering between phrases. Warm, dry, intimate room sound. Warm male tenor, gentle clearly sung melody on every line, close-miked, no rapping. 120 BPM, Bb major. Wry, gentle and quietly touched. No rap, no 808, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no rock drums.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - piano and brushes]\n\n[Verse 1]\n星期一的早上\n我說不出話來\n醫生要我安靜\n整整七天不開口\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n只好拿一支筆\n把話寫給大家\n\n[Chorus]\n我拿一塊小白板\n寫上謝謝你\n大家說話變慢了\n怕我會著急\n\n[Verse 2]\n經理不再大聲\n也拿起了筆\n同事送來一杯\n溫溫的蜂蜜水\n\n[Chorus]\n我拿一塊小白板\n寫上沒關係\n大家說話變輕了\n像在說秘密\n\n[Bridge - muted trumpet]\n第七天早上\n我說了早安\n\n[Chorus]\n那塊小白板\n收在抽屜裡\n上面還有一行字\n寫著加油你\n\n[Outro - piano and brushes fade]\n那支藍色的筆\n我還留著",
